     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Thank you so much for your prompt reply.<div>If I keep all records, some samples have 25 hours on the time-change day. Just curious, when GGIR calculate the day summary based on the .csv files, do you sum all ENMO/anglez values on all 25 hours for those samples?</div><div>Thanks.</div><div>Best,</div><div>Wei</div></div>"
